Meat Hook (equipment wheel)

- Hellfall / War Carlsson lineage art (`warcarlssonhook` / TEND chain, OCLW tip).
- PBWP pickup / wheel ownership (`HookGiver`, `HookAmmo`, `PBWP_HookToken`).
- Rope physics: ZScript port in `zscript/Player/PBWP_MeatHook.zc`
  (`Hook`, `HookTrail`, `PB_FireGrapplePulse`, `GrapplingHookHandler`,
  `PlayerPawnBase.FireHook` / `GrapplingMove`) — adapted from Project Brutality 2022
  for use on **PB Staging** (Staging has no native FireHook).
- CVars: `pb_hook` (1 = detach on re-fire, 2 = pendulum), `pb_hookboost`.
- Legacy ACS `SRC/hook.acs` and DECORATE `HookShot` kept for compatibility;
  equipment wheel and Marauder SSG hook special use the ZScript path.
